            <h3>6. Image Quality (SDXL)</h3>
            <p><strong>Excellent when optimized, variable for beginners</strong></p>

            <p>SDXL quality depends heavily on:</p>

            <ul>
                <li><strong>Model choice:</strong> Base SDXL vs fine-tuned checkpoints (Realistic Vision, DreamShaper)</li>
                <li><strong>Prompt quality:</strong> SD requires more detailed prompts than Midjourney</li>
                <li><strong>Sampling settings:</strong> Steps, CFG scale, sampler type all affect output</li>
                <li><strong>LoRAs:</strong> Adding style LoRAs dramatically improves aesthetics</li>
            </ul>

            <p><strong>Quality comparison:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Best case (optimized):</strong> Matches Midjourney V6, rivals DALL-E 3</li>
                <li><strong>Out-of-box:</strong> Good but inconsistent, requires tuning</li>
                <li><strong>Learning curve:</strong> Takes time to learn optimal settings</li>
            </ul>

